  "body": "Featuring 3 Bedrooms, 3.5 Bathrooms & 3 Ensuites\r\n\r\nStep into contemporary coastal living with this beautifully designed freehold terrace in the heart of Stanmore Bay - perfectly suited for first-home buyers, young families, savvy investors, or busy professionals seeking comfort, style, and low-maintenance living.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across three levels, this home offers flexibility, privacy, and functionality for modern lifestyles.\r\n\r\nOn the ground floor, you'll find a spacious internal-access garage alongside a private ensuite bedroom - ideal for guests, extended family, flatmates, or even a work-from-home setup with added independence.\r\n\r\nThe middle level is truly the heart of the home, featuring a sun-soaked open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area that flows seamlessly together. Whether you're entertaining friends or enjoying a quiet night in, the space feels warm, welcoming, and effortlessly functional. A convenient guest toilet adds extra practicality for everyday living.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, two beautifully appointed ensuite bedrooms provide the perfect private retreats, each offering comfort, style, and convenience - ideal for families or professionals wanting their own space.\r\n\r\nAnd the location? Simply unbeatable.\r\n\r\nJust minutes from Stanmore Bay Beach, local cafes, schools, supermarkets, and everyday amenities, everything you need is right at your doorstep. With the highly anticipated Penlink connection on the horizon, commuting convenience and future growth potential continue to make this one of the most exciting areas on the Hibiscus Coast.\r\n\r\nPlus, Snowplanet is only moments away - meaning weekend adventures are always within easy reach.\r\n\r\nStylish, functional, and incredibly hard to find at this price point - opportunities like this won't stay on the market for long.\r\n\r\nThe annal levy is $512.06 as of year 2026.\r\n\r\nCall Grace & Johnny today - and make your next move a smart one.",
